  <cac:ProcurementProject>
    <cbc:ID>2025/58613</cbc:ID>
    
    <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">R&amp;D assignments - Family Research - father's role in the family</cbc:Name>
    
    <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The aim of the assignment is to strengthen the knowledge basis on father's role in 
Family. The assignment shall contribute to giving Bufdir a better basis for developing 
good initiatives and services that support fathers' involvement in children's lives, both in 
cases where the parents live together and where they live separately. Project 
shall provide knowledge of fathers as carers and on the importance of 
the father-child relation for children's well-being, development and mental health through 
childhood and adolescence. Understanding how different conditions affect the father-child relationship is, among other things, important for further development 
parent support field in a way that account for the changes in fathers ́ role 
the last ten years.</cbc:Description>
